; The OCaml estate as one dune workspace (README.md). `dune build` from this directory
; builds every project listed here into ocaml/_build; each is its own nested dune project
; and can still be built alone with `dune build --root .` from inside it.
;
;   avatar/  the Deep machine as OCaml 5 effect handlers (library effect4_avatar, the
;            trace faces, the witness report), in byte, native and js_of_ocaml modes
;   server/  effect4d, the daemon over the avatar, three hosts from one module list
;   gen/     the LCNF route: Fibers.lean as generated typed OCaml, and its check
;   eff/     the Eff program IR as an OCaml library (typed embedding, wire, checker)
;
; Not built from here: link/ (route 1, links the Lean machine's static libraries and is
; built by link/tools/build.sh after the Lean half compiles), probes/ (single-file probes
; and corpora with their own shell builds), goldens/ (data).
(dirs avatar server gen eff)
